cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this replication package, please cite it using the metadata below.
  Prefer the working-paper / SSRN entry for the manuscript; the Typst draft in
  this repository (sample through 2025-12-31) supersedes older SSRN PDF numbers
  if they diverge.
type: software
title: "FX cointegration pairs trading — replication package"
abstract: >-
  Replication code and Typst manuscript for cointegration-based FX pairs trading
  on seven liquid USD crosses (2007–2025), comparing an Engle–Granger screen to
  an always-trade benchmark under stylized round-trip costs.
